{
  "_about": [
    "License = one 'tier:<id>' token plus optional add-on feature ids, all inside the signed 'features' array.",
    "Tiers are cumulative (ultra-lite < lite < standard < enterprise); the server expands the tier into the tile ids under 'license_tiers'.",
    "Add-ons are granted on top of the tier; an add-on also grants its riding tiles (see 'feature_children').",
    "Legacy licenses that list tile ids without a tier token keep working — every id is treated as an add-on.",
    "Source of truth: LICENSE_TIERS / LICENSE_FEATURE_CHILDREN in ssplbilling/api/license_api.py — regenerate this file after changing them.",
    "Free tiles (stock-check, whatsapp-link, whatsapp-chat, competitive) are never license gated.",
    "Use [\"*\"] to grant everything, including pages added later.",
    "features_by_category is for the license generator: pick ONE 'License Tier' entry, then untick every add-on you are not selling.",
    "The signature is computed over the sorted raw 'features' array (tier token included)."
  ],
